#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKzf003_03462:TEXT_LUCKZF003_03462_PRAYERFULVIIS03462_000_016:1"
msgid "Who knows what perils you may face in the future? <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Pray</ui-edge-color></ui-color> for the blessing of the goddess to set your mind at ease."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「イキス・マヤエの神木」にエモート「祈る」をして、<br>森の女神へと祈りを捧げよう。
#. de: Bete vor dem Heiligen Baum von Yx'Maja zu der Göttin des Waldes (Emote: Beten).
#. fr: <i>Priez</i> devant l'arbre d'Yx'Maja.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKzf003_03462:TEXT_LUCKZF003_03462_SYSTEM_000_015:1"
msgid "The wood is waiting to give its blessing to any who would <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>pray</ui-edge-color></ui-color> for it."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふふ、これで女神も森を歩む君を見守ってくれるはずよ。
#. de: Nun kannst du voller Vertrauen deiner Wege gehen. Der Segen der Göttin ist mit dir.
#. fr: Je suis sûre que la Déesse veillera sur vous, à présent.
#. speaker: PRAYERFULVIIS03462
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKzf003_03462:TEXT_LUCKZF003_03462_PRAYERFULVIIS03462_000_020:1"
msgid "Very good. Now the goddess shall watch over your every step."
msgstr ""

#. ja: さて、私は弓を作るための枝を探してから帰るわ。<br>「ラニル」伯母様に、心配しないでと伝えておいてね！
#. de: So, jetzt sehe ich mich nach geeignetem Bogenholz um. Bitte richte meiner Tante aus, dass sie sich keine Sorgen machen soll!
#. fr: Bien, je vais chercher le bois pour les arcs, maintenant. Dites à ma tante de ne pas s'inquiéter.
#. speaker: PRAYERFULVIIS03462
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKzf003_03462:TEXT_LUCKZF003_03462_PRAYERFULVIIS03462_000_021:1"
msgid "Now, I suppose it is time I seek out a suitable branch. Please tell Lanille that I shall be home soon."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 姪に声をかけてきてくれたようだな。<br>手数をかけた、礼を言おう。
#. de: Konntest du meine Nichte finden?<br>... Ihr habt zusammen vor dem heiligen Baum gebetet?
#. fr: Ah, vous avez parlé à ma nièce<nbsp>! Merci beaucoup.
#. speaker: LANILLE
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKzf003_03462:TEXT_LUCKZF003_03462_LANILLE_000_030:1"
msgid "You have returned. I hope she did not prove too troublesome."
msgstr ""

#. ja: それにしても、貴方にまで祈りを促すとは、<br>彼女の信心深さは本物だな。<br>ともかく、貴方に女神の祝福があるよう、私も祈るとしよう。
#. de: Ich bin beeindruckt, dass sie dich so ohne Weiteres dazu überreden konnte. Statt sie zu ermahnen, wie ich dir aufgetragen hatte, warst du auf einmal genauso andächtig wie sie! Ihr Glaube ist wirklich tief und echt.<br>Na, ich hoffe, dass auch dein Gebet erhört wird und die Göttin dich auf all deinen Wegen beschützt!
#. fr: Tout de même, qu'elle vous ait demandé de prier vous aussi, quelle dévotion admirable pour son jeune âge<nbsp>! Je vais prier moi aussi pour que la Déesse vous bénisse.
#. speaker: LANILLE
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKzf003_03462:TEXT_LUCKZF003_03462_LANILLE_000_031:1"
msgid "So, even a warrior such as you can be convinced to say a humble prayer? Perhaps there is power in her conviction after all. Very well, I too shall pray that the goddess keeps you in good health."
msgstr ""
